stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> InReview: Submit exact head
    InReview --> ChangesRequested: Reviewer decision
    InReview --> Approved: Approve content and plan hashes
    Approved --> Scheduled: Pin approved current head
    Scheduled --> Published: Commit publication once
    Scheduled --> Approved: Unschedule
    Draft --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    InReview --> Draft: Edit supersedes review
    ChangesRequested --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    Approved --> Draft: Edit creates new revision
    Scheduled --> Draft: Edit cancels pending schedule
    Published --> Draft: Edit keeps prior live pin
    Draft --> Cancelled: Cancel
    InReview --> Cancelled: Cancel
    ChangesRequested --> Cancelled: Cancel
    Approved --> Cancelled: Cancel
    Scheduled --> Cancelled: Cancel
    Cancelled --> [*]
    state "In Review" as InReview
    state "Changes Requested" as ChangesRequested
